    "title": "Person rescued from woods off I-285 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Atlanta News First staff ,\n8 hours ago ATLANTA, Ga. (Atlanta News First) — A person was rescued from the woods alongside I-285 on Wednesday afternoon. A spokesperson for the Atlanta Fire Rescue Department said crews responded to the area of James Jackson Parkway NW, located near the interstate, to assist in the rescue of a person in a wooded area near a creek. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
